{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"維園有野豬出沒　警方漁護持盾圍捕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PIG-CWB-261022-12.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】銅鑼灣維園有野豬出沒，漁護署人員接報到場，將牠捉走。</p><p>該隻野豬大約一米長，早上7時許開始在維園涼亭附近通道走動，再走入草叢徘徊，亦有爬上小山丘覓食。警方一度封鎖維園部分範圍，並手持長盾尾隨野豬戒備，禁止市民走近。</p><p>漁護署人員大約10時到場，用麻醉藥制服野豬，再將牠運走。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:32.972096+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:24:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.680411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:10.215030+00:00","content_hash":"8f3061a5387350a3b260d96a269bb39cfa0e67194cde88ab31a039088c4a12e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:32.972096+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}